From 90b4cb933a7764298d42ae81722029b3bc2fa74f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sanyog Kale <skale@habana.ai>
Date: Tue, 09 Jun 2020 08:37:20 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-11875] goya2: ppboot: Switch to new flow

